THIRD PARTY
-----------
Wenpu bundles no third-party libraries, fonts, images, or icon sets. Every
pattern is computed geometrically at runtime by code written for this project.
Chinese glyphs use fonts provided by the operating system. Historical pattern
names and cultural background are common knowledge, summarised for general
readers rather than quoted from a single source.
